{
  "about": [
    "Response-2000's dialogs that r2x define drives, field by field, in each dialog's own order.",
    "Read by r2x (src/r2x/catalogue.py) for the questions, the help, the worker and the tests;",
    "docs/define.md has the findings behind it. Found under Wine on 2026-10-27 (Response 1.9.7).",
    "noun: the word after define. menu: Response's main-menu command (RT_MENU of r2k.exe).",
    "title: the dialog's window title; a wizard's pages have their own titles.",
    "kind: wizard (Next, Finish), sheet (a property sheet; r2x uses the page named), dialog, or",
    "list (a sheet page with named items: Add, Modify, Delete).",
    "Fields: id is the control ID (RT_DIALOG of r2k.exe); label, the control holding the label",
    "Response shows beside it (labels can change: Select bar by area turns Bar Designation into",
    "Bar Area); unit, the control holding its unit; question, the words r2x asks with when",
    "there is no label control. kind: text, number, integer, check (a check box, yes or no),",
    "choice (a drop-down), shape (the list view of shapes), radio (one of several buttons), bar",
    "(a bar or strand designation, checked by Response against rebar.dat), first-line and",
    "other-lines (the title and the comments, which share one box). unless: skip the field when",
    "this check box is ticked. A field Response shows disabled is skipped. xml: where Response",
    "saves the value (element and attribute), for reference."
  ],
